nshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0006","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0006"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0057","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0057"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0176","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0176"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0206","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001:m0206"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":5,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":5,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"5處獨立位置，5個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-052-yuan-fu-ws2604575"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:source_review1-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"fu7_9li_uv6","source_quote":"淮南袁甫，字公胄，亦好學，與譚齊名，以詞辯稱。嘗詣中領軍何勖，自言能為劇縣。勖曰：「唯欲宰縣，不為台閣職，何也？」甫曰：「人各有能有不能。譬繒中之好莫過錦，錦不可以為㡊；谷中之美莫過稻，稻不可以為贇。是以聖王使人，必先以器，苟非周材，何能悉長！黃霸馳名於州郡，而息譽於京邑。廷尉之材，不為三公，自昔然也。」勖善之，除松滋令。轉淮南國大農、郎中令。石珩問甫曰：「卿名能辯，豈知壽陽已西何以恆旱？壽陽已東何以恆水？」甫曰：「壽陽已東皆是吳人，夫亡國之音哀以思，鼎足強邦，一朝失職，憤歎甚積，積憂成陰，陰積成雨，雨久成水，故其域恆澇也。壽陽已西皆是中國，新平強吳，美寶皆入，志盈心滿，用長歡娛。《公羊》有言，魯僖甚悅，故致旱京師。若能抑強扶弱，先疏後親，則天下和平，災害不生矣。」觀者歎其敏捷。年八十餘，卒於家。","reading":"袁甫字公胄，由何勖聽薦得松滋令，後為淮南國大農、郎中令；石珩問水旱，年八十餘卒。","note":"袁甫字公胄，由何勖聽薦得松滋令，後為淮南國大農、郎中令；石珩問水旱，年八十餘卒。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":353,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu","source_id":"s-jinshu-052-yuan-fu-ws2604575"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-yuan-fu:chronol